From b7fe589b74cba3d5f998bce4ede56cff14eba93b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: morgonf <morgonf@altlinux.org>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 01:00:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 10/21] software_isp: autofocus regions, modes and state

- statistics: sharpness and green sum on a 5x5 grid of the frame;
- AfWindows with AfMetering=Windows select grid cells (in pixel array
  coordinates, mapped through the sensor analogue crop), the central
  cell otherwise;
- AfMode Manual/Auto/Continuous, AfTrigger Start/Cancel as in the
  libcamera definitions (the branch used 1 to start);
- AfState reported in metadata, Failed for a flat region.
